  "description": "The Himiway D5 2.0 ST is a full-suspension step-through electric bike designed for riders seeking comfort, accessibility, and confidence on every ride. Whether you're a senior looking for easier mounting, a shorter rider seeking a better fit, an RV traveler exploring new destinations, or a recreational cyclist wanting a smoother riding experience, the D5 2.0 ST is built to make riding more enjoyable and less demanding.\nIts low step-through frame allows riders to get on and off the bike with ease, while the full-suspension system absorbs bumps, cracks, gravel, and uneven terrain to reduce fatigue and improve comfort over longer distances. Combined with an upright riding position, adjustable cockpit, and wide comfort saddle, the D5 2.0 ST helps riders stay comfortable from the first mile to the last.\nPowered by a 750W hub motor delivering 90Nm of torque and paired with a high-capacity Samsung/LG battery, the D5 2.0 ST provides reliable power for hill climbing, cruising, and daily transportation. Riders can switch between torque sensor and cadence sensor modes to choose a more natural riding feel or a relaxed long-range riding experience.\nWith a payload capacity of up to 400 lbs, rider fit range from 5'1\" to 6'5\", and all-terrain fat tires for added stability, the D5 2.0 ST is a popular choice for seniors, comfort-focused riders, RV travelers, commuters, and anyone looking for a full-suspension electric bike that is easy to ride and built for everyday adventures.\n\nWhy Choose the D5 2.0 ST?\n\nStep-through frame for easier access and greater confidence\nFull suspension for exceptional ride comfort\n750W motor with 90Nm torque for effortless riding\nHigh-capacity Samsung/LG battery for extended range\nTorque and cadence sensor modes in one bike\n400 lb payload capacity for a wide range of riders\nStable fat tires for pavement, gravel, and light trails\nDesigned for comfort, accessibility, and everyday versatility",
